	(text "ESP32 CORE + USB (replaces ESP32-DevKitC)\nChip-down DevKitC V4: ESP32-WROOM-32E-N4, USB-C (5.1k CC pull-downs, USBLC6 ESD), CH340C instead of CP2102N.\nUSB VBUS -> 0.5 A polyfuse -> B5819W -> +5V (OR-ed with the PSU feed from power-input); AMS1117-3.3 -> +3V3.\nCH340C runs at 3.3 V: VCC on +3V3, V3 tied to +3V3 through 0R R213, so its TXD/RXD are 3.3 V logic; 470R in series on both UART0 lines.\nAuto-program (esptool): DTR#=1, RTS#=0 -> EN low = reset;  DTR#=0, RTS#=1 -> IO0 low = boot;  DTR#=RTS# -> both released.\nI2C pull-ups (4.7k to +3V3) live only on this sheet; module sheets add none.\nGPIO12 (MTDI strap) must stay unconnected. GPIO34/35/36/39 are input-only (no internal pull-ups)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "35a5a7bc-e269-45d2-8626-e0b562e994e7")
	)
